83505c91fb837c235c3bb46a6f980","commit_subject":"Live rooms now have an audio and video call above the chat (#262). Anyone in the room can join with the microphone or with video, mute (hold the button to talk while muted), turn the camera on or off, present a screen or tab with its audio, and raise a hand. Each person gets a tile that lights up while they speak, with connection quality, a personal volume control, pin and fullscreen; a presented screen is pinned automatically and the panel can be widened. The settings choose microphone, camera and speaker, and offer Direct Audio (stereo, high bitrate, no voice processing), lowering the call during playback, silencing it while recording and mirroring the own camera. While the chat is closed, a small dock keeps mute and leave at hand and shows who speaks. The room status bar shows mic, camera and hand per person, and Alt+Shift+M, V and H toggle mic, camera and hand. A call allows up to 6 people. Audio and video go directly between the participants, and the call audio never ends up in a recording or an export. Tooltips now also show above the chat panel.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"mlflow/mlflow","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T15:52:39Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"4d267d5613b56338db9a7c548f977a4ef21b0eee","github_link":"https://github.com/mlflow/mlflow/commit/4d267d5613b56338db9a7c548f977a4ef21b0eee","commit_subject":"Require placeholder bearer authentication for telemetry proxy (#27421)","ai_tool":"Copilot"},{"repo_name":"DataDog/system-tests","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T15:52:28Z","branch":"main","commit_sha":"069cc671e510df044063fd0cdd0240442e6c7a98","github_link":"https://github.com/DataDog/system-tests/commit/069cc671e510df044063fd0cdd0240442e6c7a98","commit_subject":"Remove get_span_metrics from the interfaces, use DataDogAgentSpan.metrics (#8283)","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"ioBroker/ioBroker.js-controller","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T15:52:26Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"5f38a087bb76